  "weekly_summary": {
    "items": [
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "MTGO's event structure changed this week, but Modern remained as popular as ever, with the same number of regular Challenges firing as last week. The crowded field is nevertheless beginning to show some clearer trends. Esper Goryo's pulled ahead decisively this week. Abzan Devoted Druid Combo and Esper Blink each also exceeded a 10% share of Top 8s, while former powerhouse Boros Energy has begun to fall well off the pace.",
          "zh": "本周MO的比赛结构虽然调整，但摩登魅力不减，和上周开起来的普通挑战赛数量持平。不过混战在本周开始有一些慢慢清晰的趋势。艾斯波怨灵的领先优势开始明朗，本周优势明显。另外两套牌阿布赞缓伤和艾斯波云移的八强占比也都能超过10%。传统豪强红白能量则已经开始彻底掉队。"
        }
      },
