        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "New decks are still entering the metagame. A Dimir Erayo list using HOB's Bilbo and Key to the Side-Door, plus black for Basim, made a Top 8 this week: deck:acc94e69d84da4b303d1",
          "zh": "不过依旧还有新套牌进入环境，一套使用了HOB的Bilbo和Key to the Side-Door，并加入黑色的Basim的蓝黑伟代本周拿下一个八强：deck:acc94e69d84da4b303d1"
