        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "en": "A Jeskai Ponza build that splashes blue for Quantum Riddler as card advantage and Mana Leak as permission posted multiple high-score finishes, including a Top 8, this week: deck:78a27b72522b16549da7. Blue gives the deck answers to a wider range of situations, but also makes its mana base worse.",
          "zh": "混蓝加入Quantum Riddler续航，还有Mana Leak作为许可咒语的洁斯凯炸地套牌本周也有多个高分、八强成绩：deck:78a27b72522b16549da7。蓝色确实让套牌可以应对的局面更丰富，但法术力基础也变得更差。"
